+# Developer profile stored procedures
+
+This page provides example stored-procedure signatures, sample SQL bodies, validation and authorization patterns, audit/logging schemas, pagination/index guidance, bulk operations, instrumentation, migration artifacts, and testing guidance for a "developers" profile (username, email, bio, skills, social links). Examples target PostgreSQL (>= 12). Adapt as needed for MySQL.
