+## Testing guidelines
+- Unit tests: use pgTAP or psql scripts to:
+  - call CreateDeveloper with valid data and assert id returned.
+  - call CreateDeveloper with duplicate username/email and assert expected conflict exception.
+  - call GetDeveloperById for existing and non-existing id and assert behavior.
+  - call UpdateDeveloper to change email/bio and assert persisted changes.
+  - call DeleteDeveloper then GetDeveloperById to validate soft-delete semantics.
+
+- Integration/CI: Use containerized ephemeral database (Docker Compose or GitHub Actions services), apply migration SQL, seed minimal data, run tests, then teardown.
+
+## EXPLAIN guidance
+- Use EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS) for key queries (ListDevelopers, bulk upsert). Capture plans pre/post-indexing and record in runbook.
